#: ../../reference_manual/tools/zoom.rst:-1
msgid "Krita's zoom tool reference."
msgstr "Referência da ferramenta de zoom do Krita."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/zoom.rst:11
msgid "Tools"
msgstr "Ferramentas"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/zoom.rst:11
msgid "Zoom"
msgstr "Zoom"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/zoom.rst:16
msgid "Zoom Tool"
msgstr "Ferramenta de zoom"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/zoom.rst:18
msgid "|toolzoom|"
msgstr "|toolzoom|"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/zoom.rst:20
msgid ""
"The zoom tool allows you to zoom your canvas in and out discretely. It can "
"be found at the bottom of the toolbox, and you just activate it by selecting "
"the tool, and doing |mouseleft| on the canvas will zoom in, while :kbd:`Ctrl "
"+` |mouseleft| will zoom out."
msgstr ""
"A ferramenta de zoom permite aumentar e diminuir o zoom da tela "
"discretamente. Ela pode ser encontrada na parte inferior da caixa de "
"ferramentas. Basta ativá-la selecionando a ferramenta e pressionando |"
"mouseleft| na tela para aumentar o zoom, enquanto :kbd:`Ctrl +` |mouseleft| "
"reduz o zoom."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/zoom.rst:22
msgid "You can reverse this behavior in the :guilabel:`Tool Options`."
msgstr ""
"Você pode reverter esse comportamento nas :guilabel:`Opções da ferramenta`."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/zoom.rst:24
msgid ""
"There's a number of hotkeys associated with this tool, which makes it easier "
"to access from the other tools:"
msgstr ""
"Há uma série de teclas de atalho associadas a esta ferramenta, o que "
"facilita o acesso de outras ferramentas:"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/zoom.rst:26
msgid ""
":kbd:`Ctrl + Space +` |mouseleft| :kbd:`+ drag` on the canvas will zoom in "
"or out fluently."
msgstr ""
":kbd:`Ctrl + Espaço +` |mouseleft| :kbd:`+ arrastar` na tela aumentará ou "
"diminuirá o zoom com fluidez."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/zoom.rst:27
msgid ""
":kbd:`Ctrl +` |mousemiddle| :kbd:`+ drag` on the canvas will zoom in or out "
"fluently."
msgstr ""
":kbd:`Ctrl +` |mousemiddle| :kbd:`+ arrastar` na tela aumentará ou diminuirá "
"o zoom com fluidez."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/zoom.rst:28
msgid ""
":kbd:`Ctrl + Alt + Space +` |mouseleft| :kbd:`+ drag` on the canvas will "
"zoom in or out with discrete steps."
msgstr ""
":kbd:`Ctrl + Alt + Espaço +` |mouseleft| :kbd:`+ arrastar` na tela aumentará "
"ou diminuirá o zoom em passos discretos."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/zoom.rst:29
msgid ""
":kbd:`Ctrl + Alt +` |mousemiddle| :kbd:`+ drag` on the canvas will zoom in "
"or out with discrete steps."
msgstr ""
":kbd:`Ctrl + Alt +` |mousemiddle| :kbd:`+ arrastar` na tela aumentará ou "
"diminuirá o zoom em passos discretos."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/zoom.rst:30
msgid ":kbd:`+` will zoom in with discrete steps."
msgstr ":kbd:`+` aumentará o zoom com passos discretos."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/zoom.rst:31
msgid ":kbd:`-` will zoom out with discrete steps."
msgstr ":kbd:`-` diminuirá o zoom em passos discretos."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/zoom.rst:32
msgid ":kbd:`1` will set the zoom to 100%."
msgstr ":kbd:`1` definirá o zoom para 100%."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/zoom.rst:33
msgid ""
":kbd:`2` will set the zoom so that the document fits fully into the canvas "
"area."
msgstr ""
":kbd:`2` definirá o zoom para que o documento caiba totalmente na área da "
"tela de pintura."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/zoom.rst:34
msgid ""
":kbd:`3` will set the zoom so that the document width fits fully into the "
"canvas area."
msgstr ""
":kbd:`3` definirá o zoom para que a largura do documento caiba totalmente na "
"área da tela de pintura."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/zoom.rst:36
msgid "For more information on such hotkeys, check :ref:`navigation`."
msgstr ""
"Para mais informações sobre essas teclas de atalho, consulte :ref:"
"`navigation`."
